{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the C.U.B.E.R and teleport through this puzzle-filled world\u2026 Even with the C.U.B.E.R and all its abilities at your disposal, solving the floors that lay in front of you will be no easy task. What starts as a simplistic puzzler, grows into an equation not easily solvable. A seemingly endless number of floors lay between you and the final exit... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...Can you pass The Testing Floor? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/952560/extras/e7696a9be11b758433b773c445e7a577.poster.avif?t=1774317928\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/952560/extras/e7696a9be11b758433b773c445e7a577.webm?t=1774317928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/952560/extras/e7696a9be11b758433b773c445e7a577.mp4?t=1774317928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/952560/extras/9c838937119726958f594e293787e6c4.avif?t=1774317928\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Life took over there for a bit but I am back to working on TTF and it is nearly complete, <strong>thank you for your continued support</strong>! Sorry it took so long....and sorry it might be one of the most difficult games out there.... if someone out there actually beats this game, I would like to hear from you...you'll know how to reach me.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-